# Data Directory Layout

**All persisted data lives under `backend/data/`** (local mode), NOT at the repo root `data/`.

With `TYCHE_DATA_BACKEND=gcs`, the same relative paths resolve under `gs://{bucket}/` via `tyche/storage/StoreBackend`. Cloud batch jobs write curated data + `signals/` + `published/`; the laptop reads compact artifacts only.

**GCP batch:** `infra/gcp/README.md`, `docs/tyche_gcp_minimal_migration_spec_v2.md`. Run manifests: `runs/{job_name}/{run_id}/manifest.json`.

## Directory Map

| Store | Path | Format |
|-------|------|--------|
| Daily OHLCV bars | `backend/data/ohlcv_daily/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Intraday 5-min bars | `backend/data/intraday_5min/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Ticker metadata | `backend/data/ticker_meta.parquet` | Single file (market cap, shares outstanding, type, exchange, sector, SIC, institutional ownership). `market_cap` is derived daily as `shares_outstanding × latest close` (Polygon's static field lags months). `EQUITY_TYPE_OVERRIDES` in `data_store.py` forces selected ADRs (e.g. ARM) to `type=CS` on every meta refresh. |
| Directional alpha signals (peak) | `backend/data/alpha_signals.parquet` | Single file (big-move buy signals: alpha score, horizon, ML probabilities, demand dimensions, factors) |
| Directional alpha signals (sustained) | `backend/data/alpha_signals_sustained.parquet` | Single file — `AlphaSignalStore(variant="sustained")`. Same schema, sustained big-move models |
| Demand: fundamentals | `backend/data/fundamentals/{TICKER}.parquet` | One per ticker (Finnhub `/stock/financials` standardized, primary; as-reported quarterly/annual fallback; dual-class aliasing) |
| Demand: estimates | `backend/data/estimates/{TICKER}.parquet` | One per ticker (Finnhub Estimates-1: tidy long format — surprises, recommendations, price targets, `eps_est_avg` / `rev_est_avg`) |
| Demand: estimate snapshots | `backend/data/estimate_snapshots/{TICKER}.parquet` | Wide point-in-time EPS/revenue consensus per ingest day (`EstimateSnapshotStore`); append-only by `snapshot_date` for same-period revision velocity |
| Demand: short interest | `backend/data/short_interest/{TICKER}.parquet` | One per ticker (Polygon short interest / days-to-cover) |
| Demand: catalyst signals | `backend/data/catalyst_signals/{TICKER}.parquet` | One per ticker (news/8-K demand catalysts + Benzinga guide-vs-consensus) |
| ML alpha dataset / results | `backend/data/ml/alpha_dataset.parquet`, `backend/data/ml/alpha_results/` | Demand-feature training panel + demand-gate verdict JSON |
| ML demand-gate checkpoint | `backend/data/ml/_checkpoints/demand_gate_base_panel.parquet` | Optional Parquet round-trip after base `build_dataset` (drops fragmentation; GCS job only) |
| Options chain snapshots (Tradier) | `backend/data/options_chains/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Options history (S3 flat files) | `backend/data/options_history/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Historical IV (ATM put) | `backend/data/options_iv/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Derived metrics (IV Rank, VRP) | `backend/data/derived/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Conviction signals cache | `backend/data/conviction_signals.parquet` | Single file |
| ETF constituents | `backend/data/etf_constituents.parquet` | Single file |
| Correlations | `backend/data/correlations.parquet` | Pairwise top-N peers |
| Betas | `backend/data/betas.parquet` | Per-ticker SPY/QQQ betas |
| ML models | `backend/data/ml/models/` | XGBoost `.json` + `_meta.json` |
| ML dataset | `backend/data/ml/dataset.parquet` | Training dataset |
| News articles | `backend/data/news_articles/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| 8-K filings | `backend/data/filings_8k/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Insider transactions | `backend/data/insider_transactions/{TICKER}.parquet` | One Parquet per ticker |
| Intelligence rollups (GCS) | `signals/intelligence/*.parquet` | Cloud aggregate signals; checkpoints at `signals/intelligence/_checkpoints/` |
| Published route JSON | `published/routes/*.json` | Written by `publish_signals` for UI cache. `write_json` sanitizes Parquet NaN → `null`; read path also sanitizes legacy `NaN` tokens. |

## SQLite Databases

| DB | Path | Purpose |
|----|------|---------|
| Config | `backend/db/config.db` | User-editable operational settings |
| Conviction | `backend/db/conviction.db` | Conviction snapshots (source of truth for page loads) |
| Positions | `backend/data/positions.db` | Stock positions (`StockPosition`) and exit signals (`ExitSignal`) |
| Backtest | `backend/db/backtest.db` | Pullback events and ticker pullback profiles (simulation data only) |
| Scans | `backend/db/scans.db` | Scanner results persistence |
| Candidates | `backend/db/candidates.db` | CSP candidate persistence |
| Analyses | `backend/db/analyses.db` | LLM analysis persistence |
| News | `backend/db/news.db` | News/filing signals (**local only** — cloud jobs use Parquet rollups) |

## Python Access

All scripts run from `backend/` as cwd: `cd backend && .venv/bin/python scripts/...`

The `.venv` is at `backend/.venv/`. Use `backend/.venv/bin/python` (or activate the venv) to run scripts.

When reading data programmatically in ad-hoc scripts, use the stores:

```python
from tyche.market_data.data_store import OHLCVStore
store = OHLCVStore(data_dir='data')
df = store.read_ticker('PL')
```

Other stores follow the same pattern:

```python
from tyche.market_data.options_history_store import OptionsHistoryStore
from tyche.market_data.derived_store import DerivedMetricsStore
from tyche.market_data.data_store import TickerMetaStore
```

## Key Ingestion Scripts

| Script | Purpose | Example |
|--------|---------|---------|
| `ingest_data.py` | OHLCV daily bars from Polygon | `--from 2026-04-20 --to 2026-04-20 --no-conviction` |
| `ingest_options_flatfiles.py` | Options history from Massive S3 flat files + IV/derived metrics | `--from-ohlcv --include-today --days-back 3`; per-ticker gap fill: `--tickers ARM --days-back 730 --force` |
| `bridge_tradier_iv.py` | Bridge Tradier snapshots to IV pipeline (same-day) | Run after `ingest_options.py` |
| `backfill_shares_caps.py` | Fetch shares outstanding + reprice market cap (`shares × close`) | `--tickers MU,NVDA` (default: full universe) |
| `train_alpha.py` | Train/evaluate directional big-move models (walk-forward) | `--save-model` (also `--feature-set demand`) |
| `ingest_demand_data.py` | Ingest demand data (Finnhub fundamentals/estimates, Polygon short interest, Benzinga guidance → catalysts) | full universe, parallel rate-limited |
| `audit_demand_coverage.py` | Audit D-FUND/D-EST Parquet hygiene for alpha universe | outputs `data/ml/demand_audit_*` |
| `audit_finnhub_vs_edgar.py` | Compare SEC vs Finnhub filing dates for STALE tickers | requires `TYCHE_EDGAR_USER_AGENT_EMAIL` |
| `run_demand_gate.py` | Demand-feature walk-forward ablation + conditional promotion of `big_move_sustained_*` models | `--min-lift 0.005`; reuse build: `TYCHE_DEMAND_GATE_REUSE_DATASET=true` |
| `audit_estimate_snapshots.py` | Snapshot cadence + same-period revision availability (`estimate_snapshots/`) | `--tickers MU AVGO` |

